{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"feel\": \"起初有一种突然涌起的激动，强烈而郑重，甚至带着一点不安；随后渐渐变得柔和、谨慎。热切没有消失，却始终有些悬着，不能完全放心。\",\n  \"thread\": \"他确实很想靠近，而且这份心意强烈得无法轻轻带过。可是自己如此动心，并不等于那份亲近已经得到了回应。正因为珍惜这个可能，他才不能只顾着兴奋，仿佛一切已经有了把握。那份急切慢慢变成了小心翼翼的期待：想要的心是真的，能不能得到却还不知道。\",\n  \"used\": \"无\",\n  \"new\": [\n    \"他对一份亲近有着真切而强烈的渴望，这不是可有可无的念头。\",\n    \"自己的心意已经明确，但这份亲近能否得到回应仍没有把握，因此期待与谨慎同时存在。\"\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": \"无\"\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c453bab5-bf04-4b3e-bf91-b9f772523702", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T215548091681Z", "elapsed_seconds": 105.578, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T21:57:33.669519+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "dbb022e88016572be52bb5ede226705c1c6c33fa0adb8fe315b2260f5303afc0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_